# ============================================
# COUPON CODES CONFIGURATION
# ============================================
# Format: COUPON_[CODE]=[referrerName]|[discountType]|[discountValue]|[message]
#
# discountType options:
#   - REGISTRATION_FEE (one-time registration fee discount)
#   - MONTHLY_FEE (first month fee discount)
#
# discountValue: percentage number (e.g., 50 for 50%)
# message: Custom popup message to display
#
# HOW TO ADD NEW COUPON CODES:
# 1. Add a new line following the format above
# 2. The CODE part should be UPPERCASE (e.g., COUPON_NEWCODE)
# 3. Restart the dev server (npm run dev) for changes to take effect
#
# Example: COUPON_JOHNDOE=John Doe|REGISTRATION_FEE|25|You'll get 25% off on registration fee
# ============================================

COUPON_ZESHANIVS=Zeshan|REGISTRATION_FEE|50|You'll get 50% off on registration fee
